  "displayDescription": {
    "en": "A virtual cofounder team that identifies whether strategy, operations, growth, or an AI pilot is the next bottleneck, then turns it into one traceable result card and one practical next step.",
    "zh": "虚拟合伙人团队，判断公司下一步该解决战略、运营、增长还是AI试点，给出可执行结果卡和唯一下一步。"
  },
