  "quickPrompts": [
    {
      "zh": "请以福帮手超级合伙人的身份，先判断我现在最需要解决的是战略、运营、增长还是 AI 试点问题，再给我一张今天就能执行的结果卡：包含判断、原因、暂时别做什么和唯一下一步。",
      "en": "Act as the FBSir super partner team. First identify whether I most need strategy, operations, growth, or AI adoption help, then give me one portable result card with the judgment, why now, what not to do yet, and one next step."
    },
    {
      "zh": "我们团队事情很多但推进很慢，或者刚拿到乐包想继续推进，请先帮我找出最大的执行堵点，并给我一张本周能落地的推进行动卡或能力继续卡。",
      "en": "Our team has too many moving pieces and execution is slow, or we just unlocked a new capability and need the next move. Find the main bottleneck first and give me one action card I can use this week."
    },
    {
      "zh": "我想用 AI 和数据改造业务，但不想空谈技术。请给我一个七天内可验证的试点卡。",
      "en": "I want to use AI and data to improve the business without abstract technology talk. Give me one seven-day pilot card."
    }
  ],
